sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant SPA as React SPA
  participant API as Django API
  participant Gate as Price/news licensing gate
  participant Secrets as Server environment
  participant Providers as Provider client
  participant Finnhub
  participant Alpha as Alpha Vantage
  participant Rapid as RapidAPI/Yahoo
  participant Twelve as Twelve Data
  participant Cache as Django cache
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Actions as GitHub Actions runner
  participant HF as Local Transformers model
  participant LSTM as LSTM predictor
  participant Opinion as Opinion generation function
  participant Logs as Application logs

  User->>SPA: Request stock analysis for symbol
  SPA->>API: GET /api/v1/stock-analysis/?symbol=...
  API->>Gate: Check PRICE_DATA_PUBLIC_ACCESS
  alt Public price access disabled
    Gate-->>API: Disabled
    API-->>SPA: 200 envelope with disabled/null market fields
  else Public price access enabled
    Gate-->>API: Allowed
    API->>Providers: Request quote/candles
    Providers->>Secrets: Read server-side provider credentials
    Providers->>Finnhub: HTTPS request; key in query where configured
    Providers->>Alpha: HTTPS fallback; key in query
    Providers->>Rapid: HTTPS fallback; RapidAPI key in header
    Providers->>Twelve: HTTPS fallback; key in provider parameter
    Providers-->>API: Provider payload
    API->>API: Parse and transform market/technical values
    API->>Cache: Cache transformed values
    API->>DB: Read stored predictions/context
    API-->>SPA: Analysis response
  end
  API->>Logs: Request/error context; exception text may include provider detail

  Actions->>Actions: Run fetch_news management command
  Actions->>Secrets: Load workflow/provider/database environment
  alt NEWS_INGESTION_ENABLED is false or unset
    Actions-->>DB: No ingestion write
  else Ingestion enabled
    Actions->>Providers: Fetch provider news
    Providers->>Finnhub: HTTPS news request
    Providers->>Rapid: HTTPS news/search request
    Providers-->>Actions: Provider articles
    Actions->>HF: Local ProsusAI/finbert inference
    HF-->>Actions: Sentiment labels/scores
    Actions->>DB: Insert/update ProcessedNews
  end

  Actions->>LSTM: Run generate_predictions command
  alt PREDICTION_GENERATION_ENABLED is false or unset
    LSTM-->>Actions: Skip generation
  else Generation enabled
    LSTM->>DB: Read required input rows
    LSTM->>LSTM: Run local model inference
    LSTM->>DB: Persist Prediction rows
  end

  User->>SPA: Request /lstm-predict/ or /stock-opinion/
  SPA->>API: GET prediction/opinion endpoint
  API->>DB: Read latest Prediction row
  DB-->>API: Stored prediction or no row
  API-->>SPA: Stored prediction response; no inference on this request

  Note over Opinion,API: generate_stock_opinion exists but no active view caller was found; StockOpinion model has no verified writer.
  Note over Secrets,Providers: Provider keys originate from server environment. No user BYOK path was found.
  Note over Providers,Finnhub: Provider contracts and redistribution rights are UNVERIFIED. Price/news public access defaults false.
  Note over API,SPA: lastUpdated is request time in source, not a provider data timestamp.
